    "body": "The missing ASI layer is now installed. GameplayTweaks independently recreates the working RDO loader method: it adds the six special weapon entries with zero ammo, so it does not refill used throwables, and it keeps the four Online texture dictionaries loaded. You do not need the RDO loader.asi. Fully restart RDR2 in Story Mode, then run the store, equip, wear, and use checks from the prior comment. GameplayTweaks.log will also report online-content weapon ownership and texture-load counts. If an item fails, report the first item, the store and town, and whether it was absent, unbuyable, unequippable, or unusable.",
